                        "description": "<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/download/C/f/a/CfakepathToesOnTheNoseMENSsizechart.jpg\" class=\"popup-570-550\" target=\"_blank\">Toes on the Nose Size Chart</a> </li>\n<li>For those lazy days by the water, these Toes on the Nose&reg; Kelpfish Volley swim trumks will always be a stylish choice.</li>\n<li>Versatile short is crafted from a lightweight, stretch woven with a kelp design for effortless everyday wear. </li>\n<li>Comfortable four-way stretch with quick-dry properties keeps you cool and dry throughout the day. </li>\n<li>Antimicrobial fabrication provides lasting, continual protection against harmful microbes and is effective against stain and odor-causing bacteria. <br /></li>\n<li>UPF fabric helps protect your skin during outdoor activity by blocking harmful Ultraviolet A and Ultraviolet B rays (UVA and UVB).</li>\n<li>Stretch elasticized waist for a comfortable fit. </li>\n<li>On-seam hand pockets at the sides. </li>\n<li>Hidden side pocket at left hip. </li>\n<li>Shadowman logo at left hem. </li>\n<li>Lined with a lightweight compression brief short. </li>\n<li>87% polyester, 13% spandex. </li>\n<li>Machine wash, tumble dry. </li>\n<li>Made in the U.S.A and Imported. </li>\n<li class=\"measurements\">Measurements:\n<ul>\n    <li> Waist Measurement: 30 in</li>\n    <li> Outseam: 18 <sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>2</sub> in</li>\n    <li> Inseam: 8 in</li>\n    <li> Front Rise: 11 in</li>\n    <li> Back Rise: 16 in</li>\n    <li> Leg Opening: 11 in</li>\n    </ul>\n</li>\n<li>Product measurements were taken using size MD. Please note that measurements may vary by size.</li>\n<li>If you're not fully satisfied with your purchase, you are welcome to return any unworn and unwashed items with tags intact and original packaging included.</li>\n</ul>",
